{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014vgCbHYPxyfuNPH9GnEsqP","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"latest React version release react.dev blog\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"React のバージョン\",\"url\":\"https://ja.react.dev/versions\"},{\"title\":\"React Versions\",\"url\":\"https://zh-hant.react.dev/versions\"},{\"title\":\"React Blog\",\"url\":\"https://az.react.dev/blog\"},{\"title\":\"React Blog\",\"url\":\"https://react.dev/blog\"},{\"title\":\"React Blog\",\"url\":\"https://mn.react.dev/blog\"},{\"title\":\"React Blog\",\"url\":\"https://zh-hant.react.dev/blog\"},{\"title\":\"What is the latest version of React, and what new features does it include?\",\"url\":\"https://www.c-sharpcorner.com/forums/what-is-the-latest-version-of-react\"},{\"title\":\"DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/brilworks/react-latest-version-exploring-new-features-updates-23m1\"},{\"title\":\"uk.legacy.reactjs.org\",\"url\":\"https://uk.legacy.reactjs.org/versions\"}]\n\nThe most recent React release in these results is **React 19.2**, which the official blog covered on October 1, 2025. Newer releases may exist that these cached pages don't show, so check react.dev/versions for the current answer.\n\n- **Version listing:** The react.dev versions page, in translated copies, names 19.2 as the latest version. Latest version: 19.2\n- **Release post:** The blog's 19.2 entry from October 1, 2025 covers new features like Activity, React Performance Tracks, useEffectEvent, and more.\n- **Newest blog entry in these results:** The most recent post listed is from February 24, 2026, announcing that the React Foundation launched under the Linux Foundation. The React Foundation has officially launched under the Linux Foundation. This is governance news, not a new version.\n- **Security patch:** In December 2025, a critical vulnerability in React Server Components was fixed in 19.0.1, 19.1.2, and 19.2.1, and the team advised upgrading right away. A fix has been published in versions 19.0.1, 19.1.2, and 19.2.1. We recommend upgrading immediately.\n- **Outdated source:** A DEV Community article calls 19.1.0 the latest, but it dates from around March 2025 and is superseded. The latest version of React is 19.1.0, released in March 2025.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c3b000d9-dc41-4ef1-8992-335e348d4817","uuid":"9ce7a735-240c-46e5-aff6-a89722cf661d","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:33:19.642Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"latest React version release react.dev blog","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01NkxHBsuS3eSF6UN4BkgfdN","content":[{"title":"React のバージョン","url":"https://ja.react.dev/versions"},{"title":"React Versions","url":"https://zh-hant.react.dev/versions"},{"title":"React Blog","url":"https://az.react.dev/blog"},{"title":"React Blog","url":"https://react.dev/blog"},{"title":"React Blog","url":"https://mn.react.dev/blog"},{"title":"React Blog","url":"https://zh-hant.react.dev/blog"},{"title":"What is the latest version of React, and what new features does it include?","url":"https://www.c-sharpcorner.com/forums/what-is-the-latest-version-of-react"},{"title":"DEV Community","url":"https://dev.to/brilworks/react-latest-version-exploring-new-features-updates-23m1"},{"title":"uk.legacy.reactjs.org","url":"https://uk.legacy.reactjs.org/versions"}]},"The most recent React release in these results is **React 19.2**, which the official blog covered on October 1, 2025. Newer releases may exist that these cached pages don't show, so check react.dev/versions for the current answer.\n\n- **Version listing:** The react.dev versions page, in translated copies, names 19.2 as the latest version. Latest version: 19.2\n- **Release post:** The blog's 19.2 entry from October 1, 2025 covers new features like Activity, React Performance Tracks, useEffectEvent, and more.\n- **Newest blog entry in these result